{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What happens when reality glitches and you fall through the cracks?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673110/extras/522962e82a2cb5a3ec08dc3599f5de4c.poster.avif?t=1758625798\" width=396 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673110/extras/522962e82a2cb5a3ec08dc3599f5de4c.webm?t=1758625798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673110/extras/522962e82a2cb5a3ec08dc3599f5de4c.mp4?t=1758625798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to the Backrooms, humming fluorescent lights, and damp, musty carpets. A place outside of time and space. A place you're not supposed to be.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this atmospheric first-person psychological horror experience, you awaken in the liminal space known only as the Backrooms. There are no checkpoints. No maps. Only echoes... and something watching.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673110/extras/7db916f1c77d74d06cc8a508a7fec472.poster.avif?t=1758625798\" width=1048 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673110/extras/7db916f1c77d74d06cc8a508a7fec472.webm?t=1758625798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673110/extras/7db916f1c77d74d06cc8a508a7fec472.mp4?t=1758625798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673110?t=1758625798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673110?t=175